---

This product bundles third-party components, each under its own licence.

In the source repository:

  Microsoft Edge WebView2 SDK    third_party/webview2/LICENSE.txt
                                 third_party/webview2/NOTICE.txt

In the released package, additionally:

  Python (CPython)               ProjectOreo/python/LICENSE.txt
    Python Software Foundation License Version 2. The release ships a complete private Python
    interpreter - by size, most of the download. The build comes from astral-sh's
    python-build-standalone and carries the usual CPython dependencies with it, including
    OpenSSL, SQLite, libffi, bzip2, XZ and zlib. Every one of those licences is reproduced in
    the LICENSE.txt above, which travels inside the package.

Project Oreo Launcher also installs pyMHF and NMSpy from PyPI, and Project Oreo Runtime from
its own GitHub releases. Those are separate projects under their own licences and no part of
them is included here.
